## Lab 2: Your Agentic IaC Workstation
## Intent (the same one from Lab 1, read it the way an agent would):
##
##   "Give me a local nginx container for testing, serving a static page I control,
##   with its rendered HTML kept on disk so I can diff it in git. No secrets in the
##   container. I don't need it exposed outside this machine."
##
## There is nothing to complete in this file. This lab is not about writing
## Terraform by hand, it's about running your own agent CLI (Claude Code or
## Codex) against the intent above, twice: once at step 1 (suggest, you type
## the result yourself into a file here) and once at step 2 (draft, you let
## the agent write the file directly). See LAB.md for the exact steps.
